@startuml SEQ_02_MELIHAT_DAFTAR_ASET
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-02: Melihat Daftar Aset

actor       "Kadep / Asisten"        as User
boundary    "Browser"                as Browser
control     "InventarisController"   as Controller
entity      "Aset Model"       as ModelDA
entity      "KategoriAset Model"     as ModelKA

== Lihat Daftar Aset ==

User    -> Browser     : Buka menu Inventaris
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelDA  : Query aset berdasarkan lab
ModelDA --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller -> ModelKA  : Query semua kategori
ModelKA --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman inventaris (read-only)
Browser --> User       : Tampil daftar aset tanpa tombol CRUD

== Lihat Detail Aset ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik nama aset untuk lihat detail
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris (detail via modal)
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelDA  : Query detail aset
ModelDA --> Controller : Data aset
Controller --> Browser : Data detail aset + riwayat kondisi
Browser --> User       : Tampil popup detail: spesifikasi, kondisi, riwayat kondisi

@enduml
